window.TROUSERS_TRANSLATIONS={"id":{"← Back to Learn":"← Kembali ke Learn","Flat pattern drafting in CLO: trousers":"Pembuatan pola celana datar di CLO","Set up centimeters and an avatar, then draft the trouser pattern in the 2D workspace.":"Mulai dari satuan sentimeter dan avatar, lalu buat pola celana di area kerja 2D.","In this lesson":"Langkah pelajaran","Set units":"Pengaturan satuan","01 · Add an avatar":"01 · Tambahkan avatar","02 · Draft the rectangle and crotch depth":"02 · Buat persegi panjang dan garis kedalaman selangkangan","Set the units to centimeters":"Atur satuan ke sentimeter","This lesson uses centimeters (cm). You can convert measurements yourself or choose Settings → User Settings → User Interface → Unit, then set All Units to centimeters.":"Pelajaran ini menggunakan sentimeter (cm). Anda dapat mengonversi ukuran sendiri atau memilih Settings → User Settings → User Interface → Unit, lalu ubah All Units menjadi sentimeter.","Open User Settings · Enlarge":"Buka Pengaturan Pengguna · Perbesar","Choose centimeters · Enlarge":"Pilih sentimeter · Perbesar","Prepare the drafting workspace":"Siapkan area kerja pola","Add an avatar and adjust the workspace":"Tambahkan avatar dan atur area kerja","Choose File → Add → Avatar, then open an avatar file with the .avt extension.":"Pilih File → Add → Avatar, lalu buka berkas avatar berekstensi .avt.","This lesson focuses on 2D flat pattern drafting. Drag the divider between the 3D and 2D windows to give the 2D workspace more room.":"Pelajaran ini berfokus pada pola datar 2D. Geser pembatas jendela 3D dan 2D agar area kerja 2D lebih luas.","Demonstration · Avatar and workspace":"Video praktik · Avatar dan area kerja","Mark the starting measurements":"Tandai ukuran awal","Create a rectangle and mark crotch depth":"Buat persegi panjang dan tandai kedalaman selangkangan","Press S for Rectangle. Create a pattern 50 cm wide and 103 cm high; double-click the workspace to enter exact dimensions.":"Tekan S untuk Rectangle. Buat pola lebar 50 cm dan tinggi 103 cm; klik dua kali area kerja untuk memasukkan ukuran tepat.","With Edit Pattern, select the rectangle's top edge, right-click Offset as Internal Line, and mark 1.5 cm below the waist edge to allow room for the waist curve.":"Dengan Edit Pattern, pilih sisi atas persegi panjang, klik kanan Offset as Internal Line, dan tandai 1,5 cm di bawah pinggang untuk lengkung pinggang.","Select the original top edge again and offset it 25 cm downward to mark crotch depth. Check both guide positions against the diagram.":"Pilih lagi sisi atas asli dan geser garis internal 25 cm ke bawah untuk menandai kedalaman selangkangan. Periksa kedua garis dengan diagram.","Demonstration · Rectangle and crotch depth":"Video praktik · Persegi panjang dan kedalaman selangkangan","Guide measurements · Enlarge":"Ukuran garis panduan · Perbesar","Save the CLO project. The next trouser drafting steps will continue here.":"Simpan proyek CLO. Langkah berikutnya akan dilanjutkan di sini.","← Back to the CLO3D shelf":"← Kembali ke rak CLO3D","03 · Add hip and hem guides":"03 · Tambahkan panduan pinggul dan kelim","04 · Mark the front trouser width":"04 · Tandai lebar bagian depan celana","Continue the horizontal guides":"Lanjutkan garis panduan horizontal","Mark below the hip and above the hem":"Tandai bawah pinggul dan atas kelim","Use Edit Pattern and Offset as Internal Line again. Offset 8–10 cm downward from the hip or crotch-depth line to add another horizontal guide.":"Gunakan kembali Edit Pattern dan Offset as Internal Line. Geser 8–10 cm ke bawah dari garis pinggul atau kedalaman selangkangan untuk menambah garis panduan.","Then select the bottom edge and offset it 3–6 cm upward for a guide above the hem. Adjust both measurements within these ranges for your trouser design.":"Lalu pilih sisi bawah dan geser 3–6 cm ke atas untuk panduan di atas kelim. Sesuaikan kedua ukuran dalam kisaran ini.","Demonstration · Add horizontal guides":"Video praktik · Tambahkan garis horizontal","Guide positions · Enlarge":"Posisi garis · Perbesar","Place a precise point on the hip line":"Tambahkan titik tepat pada garis pinggul","Use X to mark the front trouser width":"Gunakan X untuk menandai lebar depan celana","Press X for Add Point/Split Line. On the second horizontal guide (the hip line), right-click to open the Split Line measurement dialog.":"Tekan X untuk Add Point/Split Line. Klik kanan pada garis horizontal kedua (garis pinggul) untuk membuka ukuran Split Line.","Set Segment 2 to 24 cm and confirm. This marks the front trouser width. Since the example rectangle is 50 cm wide, Segment 1 reads 26 cm; check which side of the line the point is measured from.":"Atur Segment 2 menjadi 24 cm. Ini menandai lebar bagian depan celana. Karena lebar total 50 cm, Segment 1 menjadi 26 cm; perhatikan arah pengukuran.","Demonstration · Mark 24 cm for the front":"Video praktik · Tandai 24 cm bagian depan","Segment measurements · Enlarge":"Ukuran segmen · Perbesar","05 · Mark front crotch extension":"05 · Tandai lebar pesak depan","06 · Calculate front leg center":"06 · Hitung pusat depan celana","07 · Mark one hem width":"07 · Tandai satu sisi kelim","08 · Finish the other hem side":"08 · Selesaikan sisi kelim lain","Draw down from the hip line":"Gambar dari garis pinggul","Mark the front crotch extension":"Tandai titik pesak depan","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Starting at the point just marked, draw a vertical guide from the waist to the crotch-depth line.":"Tekan G dan gambar garis panduan vertikal dari pinggang ke garis kedalaman selangkangan melalui titik tadi.","Use X Add Point/Split Line. Right-click the hip-line segment to the right and add a point 6 cm from the center guide to mark the front crotch extension.":"Gunakan X Add Point/Split Line. Klik kanan segmen garis pinggul di kanan dan tambahkan titik 6 cm dari garis tengah.","Demonstration · Mark the front crotch extension":"Video praktik · Tandai titik pesak depan","Calculate the center from widths":"Hitung pusat dari lebar","Calculate the front trouser centerline":"Hitung garis tengah depan celana","With Edit Pattern select the 26 cm segment toward the back piece, then hold Shift and select the 6 cm front crotch extension. Add both lengths and divide by two to locate the front leg centerline.":"Dengan Edit Pattern pilih segmen 26 cm, tahan Shift lalu pilih segmen pesak depan 6 cm. Jumlahkan dan bagi dua untuk pusat kaki depan.","In this example, (26 + 6) ÷ 2 = 16 cm. Press X, right-click the left part of the hip line, and place a point at 16 cm for the front leg center. Follow the diagram for direction.":"Contoh: (26 + 6) ÷ 2 = 16 cm. Tekan X, klik kanan bagian kiri garis pinggul dan tambahkan titik pada 16 cm.","Demonstration · Calculate the front trouser centerline":"Video praktik · Hitung garis tengah depan celana","Centerline calculation · Enlarge":"Perhitungan pusat · Perbesar","Carry the centerline to the hem":"Tarik garis tengah ke kelim","Mark the first 9.5 cm hem width":"Tandai lebar kelim pertama 9,5 cm","Press G and draw from the front leg center point on the hip line down to the hem guide, the line above the rectangle bottom edge.":"Tekan G dan gambar dari titik tengah kaki depan pada garis pinggul menuju garis kelim di atas sisi bawah.","Check the hem guide with Edit Pattern. Use X Add Point/Split Line, right-click the hem line, and add a point 9.5 cm from the centerline on one side.":"Periksa garis kelim dengan Edit Pattern. Gunakan X, klik kanan dan tambahkan titik 9,5 cm dari garis tengah pada satu sisi.","Demonstration · Mark the first 9.5 cm hem width":"Video praktik · Tandai lebar kelim pertama 9,5 cm","Repeat the width on the other side":"Ulangi lebar di sisi lain","Align points and finish the hem marks":"Sejajarkan titik dan selesaikan kelim","On the other side, use Edit Pattern to select the relevant point and line. Right-click Align/Add Point → To Internal Line to split the hem guide at the center reference.":"Di sisi lain, pilih titik dan garis dengan Edit Pattern. Klik kanan Align/Add Point → To Internal Line untuk membagi garis kelim pada garis tengah.","Then press X, right-click the other hem segment, and add a point at 9.5 cm. The front hem now has 9.5 cm on each side of the centerline; compare the final diagram.":"Tekan X, klik kanan segmen kelim sisi lain dan tambahkan titik pada 9,5 cm. Kedua sisi garis tengah masing-masing 9,5 cm.","Demonstration · Align points and finish the hem marks":"Video praktik · Sejajarkan titik dan selesaikan kelim","Align/Add Point menu · Enlarge":"Menu sejajarkan titik · Perbesar","Hem widths on both sides · Enlarge":"Lebar kedua sisi kelim · Perbesar","09 · Mark the hem fold guides":"09 · Tandai garis lipatan kelim","10 · Connect the leg outline":"10 · Hubungkan garis kaki celana","Allow length for the hem fold":"Sisakan panjang untuk lipatan kelim","Draw 6 cm vertical guides above the hem":"Gambar garis vertikal 6 cm di atas kelim","With Edit Pattern, select each 9.5 cm point marked on the hem. Right-click Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.":"Dengan Edit Pattern pilih setiap titik 9,5 cm pada kelim. Klik kanan Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.","Keep the angle at 90°, set the length to 6 cm, and check Reverse Direction so the line extends upward. Repeat on both sides for the later hem fold.":"Biarkan sudut 90°, atur panjang 6 cm dan pilih Reverse Direction agar garis memanjang ke atas. Ulangi pada kedua sisi.","Demonstration · Draw 6 cm vertical guides above the hem":"Video praktik · Gambar garis vertikal 6 cm di atas kelim","Tool menu · Enlarge":"Menu alat · Perbesar","6 cm and Reverse Direction · Enlarge":"6 cm dan arah berlawanan · Perbesar","Join the marked reference points":"Hubungkan titik panduan","Draw the front trouser leg outline":"Gambar kontur kaki depan celana","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Connect the marked point on the hip line to its corresponding hem point, then connect the front crotch point to the appropriate point at the hem.":"Tekan G dan hubungkan titik pada garis pinggul ke titik kelim yang sesuai. Lalu hubungkan titik pesak depan ke titik kelim lainnya.","Check the pairing and direction of both lines against the video. This establishes the basic front leg outline before shaping the curves.":"Periksa pasangan dan arah kedua garis sesuai video. Ini membentuk kontur dasar kaki depan sebelum kurva disempurnakan.","Demonstration · Draw the front trouser leg outline":"Video praktik · Gambar kontur kaki depan celana","11 · Fix intersections and mark crotch points":"11 · Tetapkan persilangan dan tandai titik selangkangan","Fix intersections and mark offsets":"Tetapkan persilangan dan tandai jarak","Mark crotch points at the waist and hip":"Tandai titik selangkangan di pinggang dan pinggul","With Edit Point/Line, select the vertical internal line at the front crotch and the horizontal internal line below the waist. Right-click Add Point at Intersection to fix their crossing.":"Dengan Edit Point/Line, pilih garis internal vertikal di selangkangan depan dan garis horizontal di bawah pinggang. Klik kanan Add Point at Intersection.","Add a point 0.6 cm from the centerline on the front waist line, then a point 0.5 cm from the same centerline on the hip line. Check their direction against the diagram before drawing the front crotch line.":"Tambahkan titik 0,6 cm dari garis tengah pada pinggang depan dan titik 0,5 cm dari garis tengah yang sama pada garis pinggul. Periksa arah pada diagram.","Demonstration · Fix intersections and mark crotch points":"Video praktik · Tetapkan persilangan dan tandai titik","Right-click menu · Enlarge":"Menu klik kanan · Perbesar","0.6 cm and 0.5 cm points · Enlarge":"Titik 0,6 cm dan 0,5 cm · Perbesar","12 · Draw the front crotch line":"12 · Gambar garis selangkangan depan","Connect from the front waist point":"Hubungkan mulai dari titik pinggang depan","Connect the waist, hip, and crotch":"Hubungkan pinggang, pinggul, dan selangkangan","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Click the upper 0.6 cm point and draw downward.":"Tekan G untuk Internal Polygon/Line. Klik titik 0,6 cm di atas dan tarik ke bawah.","Hold Ctrl/Command and click the 0.5 cm point on the hip line. Continue downward to the crotch segment to complete this part of the front crotch line.":"Tahan Ctrl/Command dan klik titik 0,5 cm pada garis pinggul. Lanjutkan ke bawah hingga segmen selangkangan.","Demonstration · Draw the front crotch line":"Video praktik · Gambar garis selangkangan depan","13 · Mark the midpoint on the side seam":"13 · Tandai titik tengah pada jahitan samping","Calculate from the crotch-line distance":"Hitung dari jarak pada garis selangkangan","Fix the crotch intersection and add a point":"Tetapkan persilangan selangkangan dan tambah titik","With Edit Point/Line, select the crotch-bottom line and the side line. Right-click Add Point at Intersection to fix their crossing.":"Dengan Edit Point/Line, pilih garis dasar selangkangan dan garis samping. Klik kanan Add Point at Intersection.","Measure distance A between the front crotch extension and inseam. Divide A by two and use that result to add a point on the side seam. Check its position against the diagram.":"Ukur jarak A antara lebar selangkangan depan dan jahitan dalam. Bagi A dengan dua untuk menambah titik pada jahitan samping.","Demonstration · Mark the side-seam midpoint":"Video praktik · Tandai titik tengah sisi","A ÷ 2 point diagram · Enlarge":"Diagram titik A ÷ 2 · Perbesar","14 · Organize the guide lines":"14 · Rapikan garis panduan","Connect the two marked points":"Hubungkan dua titik yang ditandai","Convert the guides to internal lines":"Ubah panduan menjadi garis internal","Connect the newly added point to the intersection of the crotch-bottom and side lines as a guide for the next drawing step.":"Hubungkan titik baru dengan persilangan garis dasar selangkangan dan garis samping sebagai panduan.","With Edit Point/Line, select the two guide lines and convert them to internal lines to keep the pattern view clear. They are positioning guides.":"Dengan Edit Point/Line, pilih dua garis panduan dan ubah menjadi garis internal agar pola terlihat jelas.","Demonstration · Organize the guide lines":"Video praktik · Rapikan garis panduan","15 · Draw and refine the crotch curve":"15 · Gambar dan rapikan kurva selangkangan","Use a few points along the dashed guide":"Gunakan sedikit titik sepanjang panduan","Trace with G, then refine with V":"Gambar dengan G, lalu rapikan dengan V","Press G and start at the upper marked point. After the first click, hold Ctrl/Command to form a curve. Follow the dashed guide with only a few points, ending at the crotch-bottom intersection.":"Tekan G, mulai dari titik atas. Setelah klik pertama, tahan Ctrl/Command untuk membuat kurva. Ikuti garis putus-putus dengan sedikit titik hingga persilangan dasar selangkangan.","Double-click to finish drawing. Press V for Edit Curve Point and refine the curve.":"Klik dua kali untuk menyelesaikan gambar. Tekan V untuk Edit Curve Point dan rapikan kurva.","Demonstration · Draw and refine the crotch curve":"Video praktik · Gambar dan rapikan kurva","V curve-point tool · Enlarge":"Alat titik kurva V · Perbesar","16 · Create a 6 cm perpendicular line":"16 · Buat garis tegak lurus 6 cm","Make the lines meet precisely":"Pastikan garis bertemu tepat","Create a perpendicular line and merge points":"Buat garis tegak lurus dan gabungkan titik","With Edit Point/Line, select the line drawn in the previous step. Right-click Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.":"Dengan Edit Point/Line, pilih garis dari langkah sebelumnya. Klik kanan Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.","Set the length to 6 cm and Distance from Segment Edge to 0 cm so the perpendicular starts at the segment end and meets the original line.":"Atur panjang 6 cm dan Distance from Segment Edge menjadi 0 cm agar garis tegak lurus mulai dari ujung segmen.","Box-select the two points at the intersection, right-click, and choose Merge Points.":"Pilih kotak dua titik pada persilangan, klik kanan, lalu Merge Points.","Demonstration · Create the perpendicular and merge points":"Video praktik · Garis tegak lurus dan gabungkan titik","Perpendicular-line menu · Enlarge":"Menu garis tegak lurus · Perbesar","6 cm and 0 cm settings · Enlarge":"Pengaturan 6 cm dan 0 cm · Perbesar","Merge Points menu · Enlarge":"Menu Merge Points · Perbesar","17 · Adjust the line position":"17 · Sesuaikan posisi garis","Align the left intersection":"Sejajarkan titik kiri","Move the line upward and check the intersection":"Geser garis ke atas dan periksa persilangan","With Edit Pattern, select the line just created and move it upward until its left point meets the corresponding line.":"Dengan Edit Pattern, pilih garis yang baru dibuat dan geser ke atas hingga titik kirinya bertemu garis yang sesuai.","Check the point-to-line intersection against the video before continuing the draft.":"Periksa persilangan titik dan garis dengan video sebelum melanjutkan pola.","Demonstration · Adjust the line position":"Video praktik · Sesuaikan posisi garis"},"ru":{"← Back to Learn":"← Назад в Learn","Flat pattern drafting in CLO: trousers":"Плоское построение брюк в CLO","Set up centimeters and an avatar, then draft the trouser pattern in the 2D workspace.":"Начните с сантиметров и аватара, затем постройте выкройку брюк в 2D.","In this lesson":"Шаги урока","Set units":"Настройка единиц","01 · Add an avatar":"01 · Добавить аватар","02 · Draft the rectangle and crotch depth":"02 · Прямоугольник и глубина шага","Set the units to centimeters":"Установите сантиметры","This lesson uses centimeters (cm). You can convert measurements yourself or choose Settings → User Settings → User Interface → Unit, then set All Units to centimeters.":"В уроке используются сантиметры (cm). Можно пересчитать размеры самостоятельно или выбрать Settings → User Settings → User Interface → Unit и установить All Units в сантиметрах.","Open User Settings · Enlarge":"Открыть настройки · Увеличить","Choose centimeters · Enlarge":"Выбрать сантиметры · Увеличить","Prepare the drafting workspace":"Подготовка рабочего пространства","Add an avatar and adjust the workspace":"Добавьте аватар и настройте окна","Choose File → Add → Avatar, then open an avatar file with the .avt extension.":"Выберите File → Add → Avatar и откройте файл аватара с расширением .avt.","This lesson focuses on 2D flat pattern drafting. Drag the divider between the 3D and 2D windows to give the 2D workspace more room.":"Урок посвящён построению в 2D. Передвиньте границу между окнами 3D и 2D, чтобы расширить рабочую область 2D.","Demonstration · Avatar and workspace":"Видео · Аватар и рабочая область","Mark the starting measurements":"Начальные размеры","Create a rectangle and mark crotch depth":"Создайте прямоугольник и отметьте глубину шага","Press S for Rectangle. Create a pattern 50 cm wide and 103 cm high; double-click the workspace to enter exact dimensions.":"Нажмите S для инструмента Rectangle. Создайте деталь шириной 50 cm и высотой 103 cm; двойной щелчок позволяет ввести точные размеры.","With Edit Pattern, select the rectangle's top edge, right-click Offset as Internal Line, and mark 1.5 cm below the waist edge to allow room for the waist curve.":"Инструментом Edit Pattern выберите верхнюю сторону, через контекстное меню Offset as Internal Line отложите вниз 1,5 cm для изгиба талии.","Select the original top edge again and offset it 25 cm downward to mark crotch depth. Check both guide positions against the diagram.":"Снова выберите исходный верхний край и отложите вниз 25 cm, отмечая глубину шага. Сверьте обе линии со схемой.","Demonstration · Rectangle and crotch depth":"Видео · Прямоугольник и глубина шага","Guide measurements · Enlarge":"Размеры линий · Увеличить","Save the CLO project. The next trouser drafting steps will continue here.":"Сохраните проект CLO. Следующие шаги продолжатся здесь.","← Back to the CLO3D shelf":"← Назад к полке CLO3D","03 · Add hip and hem guides":"03 · Добавить линии бёдер и низа","04 · Mark the front trouser width":"04 · Отметить ширину передней детали","Continue the horizontal guides":"Продолжите горизонтальные линии","Mark below the hip and above the hem":"Отметьте линии ниже бёдер и выше низа","Use Edit Pattern and Offset as Internal Line again. Offset 8–10 cm downward from the hip or crotch-depth line to add another horizontal guide.":"Снова используйте Edit Pattern и Offset as Internal Line. От линии бёдер или глубины шага отложите вниз 8–10 см для новой горизонтальной линии.","Then select the bottom edge and offset it 3–6 cm upward for a guide above the hem. Adjust both measurements within these ranges for your trouser design.":"Выберите нижний край и отложите вверх 3–6 см для линии над низом брюк. Оба размера можно выбрать в указанных пределах.","Demonstration · Add horizontal guides":"Видео · Горизонтальные линии","Guide positions · Enlarge":"Расположение линий · Увеличить","Place a precise point on the hip line":"Точно добавьте точку на линии бёдер","Use X to mark the front trouser width":"Используйте X для ширины передней детали","Press X for Add Point/Split Line. On the second horizontal guide (the hip line), right-click to open the Split Line measurement dialog.":"Нажмите X для Add Point/Split Line. На второй горизонтальной линии (линии бёдер) щёлкните правой кнопкой, чтобы открыть окно размеров Split Line.","Set Segment 2 to 24 cm and confirm. This marks the front trouser width. Since the example rectangle is 50 cm wide, Segment 1 reads 26 cm; check which side of the line the point is measured from.":"Установите Segment 2 на 24 см. Это ширина передней детали. При общей ширине 50 см Segment 1 составит 26 см; проверьте направление отсчёта.","Demonstration · Mark 24 cm for the front":"Видео · 24 см передней детали","Segment measurements · Enlarge":"Размеры отрезков · Увеличить","05 · Mark front crotch extension":"05 · Ширина переднего шага","06 · Calculate front leg center":"06 · Центр передней детали","07 · Mark one hem width":"07 · Ширина одной стороны низа","08 · Finish the other hem side":"08 · Вторая сторона низа","Draw down from the hip line":"Линия от бёдер","Mark the front crotch extension":"Отметьте передний шаг","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Starting at the point just marked, draw a vertical guide from the waist to the crotch-depth line.":"Нажмите G и проведите вертикальную линию через отмеченную точку от талии до линии глубины шага.","Use X Add Point/Split Line. Right-click the hip-line segment to the right and add a point 6 cm from the center guide to mark the front crotch extension.":"Инструментом X Add Point/Split Line щёлкните правой кнопкой на отрезке линии бёдер справа и добавьте точку в 6 см от оси.","Demonstration · Mark the front crotch extension":"Видео · Отметьте передний шаг","Calculate the center from widths":"Центр по ширинам","Calculate the front trouser centerline":"Рассчитайте центральную линию передней детали","With Edit Pattern select the 26 cm segment toward the back piece, then hold Shift and select the 6 cm front crotch extension. Add both lengths and divide by two to locate the front leg centerline.":"Инструментом Edit Pattern выберите отрезок 26 см, с Shift добавьте передний шаг 6 см. Сумму разделите на два.","In this example, (26 + 6) ÷ 2 = 16 cm. Press X, right-click the left part of the hip line, and place a point at 16 cm for the front leg center. Follow the diagram for direction.":"Здесь (26 + 6) ÷ 2 = 16 см. Нажмите X и добавьте точку на левой части линии бёдер на расстоянии 16 см.","Demonstration · Calculate the front trouser centerline":"Видео · Рассчитайте центральную линию передней детали","Centerline calculation · Enlarge":"Расчёт центра · Увеличить","Carry the centerline to the hem":"Продлите центр к низу","Mark the first 9.5 cm hem width":"Отметьте первые 9,5 см низа","Press G and draw from the front leg center point on the hip line down to the hem guide, the line above the rectangle bottom edge.":"Нажмите G и проведите линию от центра передней штанины на линии бёдер до линии низа над нижним краем.","Check the hem guide with Edit Pattern. Use X Add Point/Split Line, right-click the hem line, and add a point 9.5 cm from the centerline on one side.":"Проверьте линию низа инструментом Edit Pattern. С помощью X добавьте точку в 9,5 см от оси с одной стороны.","Demonstration · Mark the first 9.5 cm hem width":"Видео · Отметьте первые 9,5 см низа","Repeat the width on the other side":"Повторите ширину с другой стороны","Align points and finish the hem marks":"Выровняйте точки и закончите низ","On the other side, use Edit Pattern to select the relevant point and line. Right-click Align/Add Point → To Internal Line to split the hem guide at the center reference.":"С другой стороны выделите точку и линию через Edit Pattern. В контекстном меню выберите Align/Add Point → To Internal Line.","Then press X, right-click the other hem segment, and add a point at 9.5 cm. The front hem now has 9.5 cm on each side of the centerline; compare the final diagram.":"Нажмите X и добавьте на другом отрезке низа точку в 9,5 см. По обе стороны оси теперь по 9,5 см.","Demonstration · Align points and finish the hem marks":"Видео · Выровняйте точки и закончите низ","Align/Add Point menu · Enlarge":"Меню выравнивания · Увеличить","Hem widths on both sides · Enlarge":"Ширина низа с обеих сторон · Увеличить","09 · Mark the hem fold guides":"09 · Линии подгиба низа","10 · Connect the leg outline":"10 · Соединить контур брючины","Allow length for the hem fold":"Оставьте длину для подгиба","Draw 6 cm vertical guides above the hem":"Проведите вертикали 6 см над низом","With Edit Pattern, select each 9.5 cm point marked on the hem. Right-click Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.":"Инструментом Edit Pattern выберите точки 9,5 см на линии низа. Выберите Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.","Keep the angle at 90°, set the length to 6 cm, and check Reverse Direction so the line extends upward. Repeat on both sides for the later hem fold.":"Оставьте угол 90°, задайте длину 6 см и включите Reverse Direction, чтобы линия шла вверх. Повторите с обеих сторон.","Demonstration · Draw 6 cm vertical guides above the hem":"Видео · Проведите вертикали 6 см над низом","Tool menu · Enlarge":"Меню инструмента · Увеличить","6 cm and Reverse Direction · Enlarge":"6 см и обратное направление · Увеличить","Join the marked reference points":"Соедините отмеченные точки","Draw the front trouser leg outline":"Постройте контур передней брючины","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Connect the marked point on the hip line to its corresponding hem point, then connect the front crotch point to the appropriate point at the hem.":"Нажмите G и соедините точку на линии бёдер с соответствующей точкой низа, затем соедините точку переднего шага с другой точкой низа.","Check the pairing and direction of both lines against the video. This establishes the basic front leg outline before shaping the curves.":"Сверьте соответствие и направление обеих линий с видео. Так получится основа передней брючины до уточнения кривых.","Demonstration · Draw the front trouser leg outline":"Видео · Постройте контур передней брючины","11 · Fix intersections and mark crotch points":"11 · Закрепить пересечения и отметить точки шага","Fix intersections and mark offsets":"Закрепить пересечения и отметить отступы","Mark crotch points at the waist and hip":"Отметить точки шаговой линии на талии и бёдрах","With Edit Point/Line, select the vertical internal line at the front crotch and the horizontal internal line below the waist. Right-click Add Point at Intersection to fix their crossing.":"Инструментом Edit Point/Line выделите вертикальную внутреннюю линию переднего шага и горизонтальную линию ниже талии. Правой кнопкой выберите Add Point at Intersection.","Add a point 0.6 cm from the centerline on the front waist line, then a point 0.5 cm from the same centerline on the hip line. Check their direction against the diagram before drawing the front crotch line.":"Добавьте точку в 0,6 см от средней линии на передней талии и точку в 0,5 см от той же линии на линии бёдер. Проверьте направление по схеме.","Demonstration · Fix intersections and mark crotch points":"Видео · Закрепить пересечения и отметить точки","Right-click menu · Enlarge":"Контекстное меню · Увеличить","0.6 cm and 0.5 cm points · Enlarge":"Точки 0,6 и 0,5 см · Увеличить","12 · Draw the front crotch line":"12 · Провести переднюю шаговую линию","Connect from the front waist point":"Соединить точки от передней талии","Connect the waist, hip, and crotch":"Соединить талию, бёдра и шаг","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Click the upper 0.6 cm point and draw downward.":"Нажмите G для Internal Polygon/Line. Щёлкните верхнюю точку 0,6 см и ведите линию вниз.","Hold Ctrl/Command and click the 0.5 cm point on the hip line. Continue downward to the crotch segment to complete this part of the front crotch line.":"Удерживая Ctrl/Command, щёлкните точку 0,5 см на линии бёдер. Продолжите линию вниз до шагового отрезка.","Demonstration · Draw the front crotch line":"Видео · Провести переднюю шаговую линию","13 · Mark the midpoint on the side seam":"13 · Отметить середину на боковом шве","Calculate from the crotch-line distance":"Рассчитать по расстоянию на линии шага","Fix the crotch intersection and add a point":"Закрепить пересечение шага и добавить точку","With Edit Point/Line, select the crotch-bottom line and the side line. Right-click Add Point at Intersection to fix their crossing.":"Инструментом Edit Point/Line выделите линию низа шага и боковую линию. Правой кнопкой выберите Add Point at Intersection.","Measure distance A between the front crotch extension and inseam. Divide A by two and use that result to add a point on the side seam. Check its position against the diagram.":"Измерьте расстояние A между передним шаговым выступом и внутренним швом. Разделите A пополам и отметьте точку на боковом шве.","Demonstration · Mark the side-seam midpoint":"Видео · Отметить середину бокового шва","A ÷ 2 point diagram · Enlarge":"Схема точки A ÷ 2 · Увеличить","14 · Organize the guide lines":"14 · Упорядочить направляющие линии","Connect the two marked points":"Соединить две отмеченные точки","Convert the guides to internal lines":"Преобразовать вспомогательные линии во внутренние","Connect the newly added point to the intersection of the crotch-bottom and side lines as a guide for the next drawing step.":"Соедините новую точку с пересечением нижней шаговой и боковой линий для следующего построения.","With Edit Point/Line, select the two guide lines and convert them to internal lines to keep the pattern view clear. They are positioning guides.":"Инструментом Edit Point/Line выделите две направляющие и преобразуйте их во внутренние линии.","Demonstration · Organize the guide lines":"Видео · Упорядочить направляющие","15 · Draw and refine the crotch curve":"15 · Построить и уточнить шаговую кривую","Use a few points along the dashed guide":"Поставить немного точек вдоль пунктирной линии","Trace with G, then refine with V":"Обвести клавишей G и уточнить клавишей V","Press G and start at the upper marked point. After the first click, hold Ctrl/Command to form a curve. Follow the dashed guide with only a few points, ending at the crotch-bottom intersection.":"Нажмите G и начните с верхней точки. После первого щелчка удерживайте Ctrl/Command для кривой. Следуйте пунктиру с минимумом точек до нижнего пересечения шага.","Double-click to finish drawing. Press V for Edit Curve Point and refine the curve.":"Двойным щелчком завершите линию. Нажмите V для Edit Curve Point и уточните форму кривой.","Demonstration · Draw and refine the crotch curve":"Видео · Построить и уточнить шаговую кривую","V curve-point tool · Enlarge":"Инструмент кривых V · Увеличить","16 · Create a 6 cm perpendicular line":"16 · Построить перпендикуляр 6 см","Make the lines meet precisely":"Точно совместить линии","Create a perpendicular line and merge points":"Построить перпендикуляр и объединить точки","With Edit Point/Line, select the line drawn in the previous step. Right-click Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.":"Инструментом Edit Point/Line выделите линию из прошлого шага. Правой кнопкой выберите Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.","Set the length to 6 cm and Distance from Segment Edge to 0 cm so the perpendicular starts at the segment end and meets the original line.":"Задайте длину 6 см и Distance from Segment Edge — 0 см, чтобы перпендикуляр начинался от конца отрезка.","Box-select the two points at the intersection, right-click, and choose Merge Points.":"Выделите рамкой две точки пересечения, затем выберите Merge Points.","Demonstration · Create the perpendicular and merge points":"Видео · Построить перпендикуляр и объединить точки","Perpendicular-line menu · Enlarge":"Меню перпендикуляра · Увеличить","6 cm and 0 cm settings · Enlarge":"Параметры 6 см и 0 см · Увеличить","Merge Points menu · Enlarge":"Меню Merge Points · Увеличить","17 · Adjust the line position":"17 · Скорректировать положение линии","Align the left intersection":"Совместить левую точку","Move the line upward and check the intersection":"Поднять линию и проверить пересечение","With Edit Pattern, select the line just created and move it upward until its left point meets the corresponding line.":"Инструментом Edit Pattern выделите созданную линию и поднимите её, пока левая точка не пересечётся с соответствующей линией.","Check the point-to-line intersection against the video before continuing the draft.":"Сверьте пересечение точки и линии с видео перед продолжением построения.","Demonstration · Adjust the line position":"Видео · Скорректировать положение линии"},"de":{"← Back to Learn":"← Zurück zu Learn","Flat pattern drafting in CLO: trousers":"Flachschnitt für Hosen in CLO","Set up centimeters and an avatar, then draft the trouser pattern in the 2D workspace.":"Beginne mit Zentimetern und einem Avatar und zeichne dann das Hosenmuster im 2D-Bereich.","In this lesson":"In dieser Lektion","Set units":"Einheiten einstellen","01 · Add an avatar":"01 · Avatar hinzufügen","02 · Draft the rectangle and crotch depth":"02 · Rechteck und Schritttiefe","Set the units to centimeters":"Einheit auf Zentimeter stellen","This lesson uses centimeters (cm). You can convert measurements yourself or choose Settings → User Settings → User Interface → Unit, then set All Units to centimeters.":"Diese Lektion verwendet Zentimeter (cm). Rechne Maße selbst um oder wähle Settings → User Settings → User Interface → Unit und stelle All Units auf Zentimeter.","Open User Settings · Enlarge":"Benutzereinstellungen öffnen · Vergrößern","Choose centimeters · Enlarge":"Zentimeter wählen · Vergrößern","Prepare the drafting workspace":"Arbeitsbereich vorbereiten","Add an avatar and adjust the workspace":"Avatar hinzufügen und Fenster anpassen","Choose File → Add → Avatar, then open an avatar file with the .avt extension.":"Wähle File → Add → Avatar und öffne eine Avatar-Datei mit der Endung .avt.","This lesson focuses on 2D flat pattern drafting. Drag the divider between the 3D and 2D windows to give the 2D workspace more room.":"Diese Lektion konzentriert sich auf den 2D-Flachschnitt. Ziehe die Trennlinie zwischen 3D- und 2D-Fenster, damit der 2D-Bereich breiter wird.","Demonstration · Avatar and workspace":"Video · Avatar und Arbeitsbereich","Mark the starting measurements":"Ausgangsmaße markieren","Create a rectangle and mark crotch depth":"Rechteck erstellen und Schritttiefe markieren","Press S for Rectangle. Create a pattern 50 cm wide and 103 cm high; double-click the workspace to enter exact dimensions.":"Drücke S für Rectangle. Erstelle ein Schnittteil mit 50 cm Breite und 103 cm Höhe; per Doppelklick gibst du exakte Maße ein.","With Edit Pattern, select the rectangle's top edge, right-click Offset as Internal Line, and mark 1.5 cm below the waist edge to allow room for the waist curve.":"Wähle mit Edit Pattern die obere Kante und über Offset as Internal Line einen Abstand von 1,5 cm nach unten für die Taillenrundung.","Select the original top edge again and offset it 25 cm downward to mark crotch depth. Check both guide positions against the diagram.":"Wähle erneut die ursprüngliche Oberkante und versetze eine interne Linie 25 cm nach unten, um die Schritttiefe zu markieren. Prüfe beide Linien anhand der Skizze.","Demonstration · Rectangle and crotch depth":"Video · Rechteck und Schritttiefe","Guide measurements · Enlarge":"Hilfslinienmaße · Vergrößern","Save the CLO project. The next trouser drafting steps will continue here.":"Speichere das CLO-Projekt. Weitere Schritte folgen hier.","← Back to the CLO3D shelf":"← Zurück zum CLO3D-Regal","03 · Add hip and hem guides":"03 · Hüft- und Saumlinien ergänzen","04 · Mark the front trouser width":"04 · Breite des Vorderhosenteils markieren","Continue the horizontal guides":"Waagerechte Hilfslinien fortsetzen","Mark below the hip and above the hem":"Unterhalb der Hüfte und oberhalb des Saums markieren","Use Edit Pattern and Offset as Internal Line again. Offset 8–10 cm downward from the hip or crotch-depth line to add another horizontal guide.":"Nutze erneut Edit Pattern und Offset as Internal Line. Versetze von der Hüft- bzw. Schritttiefenlinie aus eine Hilfslinie 8–10 cm nach unten.","Then select the bottom edge and offset it 3–6 cm upward for a guide above the hem. Adjust both measurements within these ranges for your trouser design.":"Wähle danach die untere Kante und versetze eine Hilfslinie 3–6 cm nach oben. Beide Maße kannst du innerhalb dieser Bereiche anpassen.","Demonstration · Add horizontal guides":"Video · Waagerechte Hilfslinien","Guide positions · Enlarge":"Hilfslinien · Vergrößern","Place a precise point on the hip line":"Punkt auf der Hüftlinie präzise setzen","Use X to mark the front trouser width":"Mit X die Breite des Vorderhosenteils markieren","Press X for Add Point/Split Line. On the second horizontal guide (the hip line), right-click to open the Split Line measurement dialog.":"Drücke X für Add Point/Split Line. Klicke auf der zweiten waagerechten Linie (Hüftlinie) mit rechts, um die Maße zu öffnen.","Set Segment 2 to 24 cm and confirm. This marks the front trouser width. Since the example rectangle is 50 cm wide, Segment 1 reads 26 cm; check which side of the line the point is measured from.":"Stelle Segment 2 auf 24 cm. Damit ist die Breite des Vorderhosenteils markiert. Bei insgesamt 50 cm zeigt Segment 1 dann 26 cm; beachte die Messrichtung.","Demonstration · Mark 24 cm for the front":"Video · 24 cm für das Vorderteil","Segment measurements · Enlarge":"Segmentmaße · Vergrößern","05 · Mark front crotch extension":"05 · Vordere Schrittweite","06 · Calculate front leg center":"06 · Vordere Beinmitte berechnen","07 · Mark one hem width":"07 · Eine Saumbreite markieren","08 · Finish the other hem side":"08 · Andere Saumseite ergänzen","Draw down from the hip line":"Von der Hüftlinie zeichnen","Mark the front crotch extension":"Vordere Schrittweite markieren","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Starting at the point just marked, draw a vertical guide from the waist to the crotch-depth line.":"Drücke G und zeichne durch den markierten Punkt eine senkrechte Linie von der Taille bis zur Schritttiefenlinie.","Use X Add Point/Split Line. Right-click the hip-line segment to the right and add a point 6 cm from the center guide to mark the front crotch extension.":"Setze mit X Add Point/Split Line auf dem rechten Hüftlinienabschnitt einen Punkt 6 cm von der Mittellinie entfernt.","Demonstration · Mark the front crotch extension":"Video · Vordere Schrittweite markieren","Calculate the center from widths":"Mitte aus Breiten berechnen","Calculate the front trouser centerline":"Vordere Beinmitte berechnen","With Edit Pattern select the 26 cm segment toward the back piece, then hold Shift and select the 6 cm front crotch extension. Add both lengths and divide by two to locate the front leg centerline.":"Wähle mit Edit Pattern den 26-cm-Abschnitt und mit Shift die 6-cm-Schrittweite. Addiere beide und halbiere die Summe.","In this example, (26 + 6) ÷ 2 = 16 cm. Press X, right-click the left part of the hip line, and place a point at 16 cm for the front leg center. Follow the diagram for direction.":"Hier gilt (26 + 6) ÷ 2 = 16 cm. Setze mit X auf dem linken Teil der Hüftlinie einen Punkt bei 16 cm.","Demonstration · Calculate the front trouser centerline":"Video · Vordere Beinmitte berechnen","Centerline calculation · Enlarge":"Mittenberechnung · Vergrößern","Carry the centerline to the hem":"Mittellinie zum Saum führen","Mark the first 9.5 cm hem width":"Erste 9,5 cm Saumbreite markieren","Press G and draw from the front leg center point on the hip line down to the hem guide, the line above the rectangle bottom edge.":"Zeichne mit G vom vorderen Beinmittelpunkt auf der Hüftlinie zur Saumlinie oberhalb der Unterkante.","Check the hem guide with Edit Pattern. Use X Add Point/Split Line, right-click the hem line, and add a point 9.5 cm from the centerline on one side.":"Prüfe die Saumlinie mit Edit Pattern. Setze mit X auf einer Seite einen Punkt 9,5 cm von der Mittellinie entfernt.","Demonstration · Mark the first 9.5 cm hem width":"Video · Erste 9,5 cm Saumbreite markieren","Repeat the width on the other side":"Breite auf der anderen Seite wiederholen","Align points and finish the hem marks":"Punkte ausrichten und Saum markieren","On the other side, use Edit Pattern to select the relevant point and line. Right-click Align/Add Point → To Internal Line to split the hem guide at the center reference.":"Wähle auf der anderen Seite Punkt und Linie mit Edit Pattern. Nutze Align/Add Point → To Internal Line für einen teilbaren Punkt an der Mitte.","Then press X, right-click the other hem segment, and add a point at 9.5 cm. The front hem now has 9.5 cm on each side of the centerline; compare the final diagram.":"Setze mit X auf dem anderen Saumabschnitt ebenfalls einen Punkt bei 9,5 cm. Beide Seiten der Mittellinie messen nun je 9,5 cm.","Demonstration · Align points and finish the hem marks":"Video · Punkte ausrichten und Saum markieren","Align/Add Point menu · Enlarge":"Punkte ausrichten · Vergrößern","Hem widths on both sides · Enlarge":"Saumbreiten beidseits · Vergrößern","09 · Mark the hem fold guides":"09 · Saumumschlag markieren","10 · Connect the leg outline":"10 · Hosenbeinkontur verbinden","Allow length for the hem fold":"Länge für den Saumumschlag vorsehen","Draw 6 cm vertical guides above the hem":"6 cm senkrechte Linien über dem Saum zeichnen","With Edit Pattern, select each 9.5 cm point marked on the hem. Right-click Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.":"Wähle mit Edit Pattern die 9,5-cm-Punkte am Saum. Rechtsklick: Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.","Keep the angle at 90°, set the length to 6 cm, and check Reverse Direction so the line extends upward. Repeat on both sides for the later hem fold.":"Lasse den Winkel bei 90°, stelle 6 cm ein und aktiviere Reverse Direction, damit die Linie nach oben verläuft. Wiederhole dies auf beiden Seiten.","Demonstration · Draw 6 cm vertical guides above the hem":"Video · 6 cm senkrechte Linien über dem Saum zeichnen","Tool menu · Enlarge":"Werkzeugmenü · Vergrößern","6 cm and Reverse Direction · Enlarge":"6 cm und Gegenrichtung · Vergrößern","Join the marked reference points":"Markierte Punkte verbinden","Draw the front trouser leg outline":"Vorderes Hosenbein zeichnen","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Connect the marked point on the hip line to its corresponding hem point, then connect the front crotch point to the appropriate point at the hem.":"Drücke G und verbinde den Hüftpunkt mit dem passenden Saumpunkt. Verbinde dann den vorderen Schrittpunkt mit dem entsprechenden Saumpunkt.","Check the pairing and direction of both lines against the video. This establishes the basic front leg outline before shaping the curves.":"Prüfe Zuordnung und Verlauf beider Linien im Video. So entsteht die Grundkontur des vorderen Hosenbeins vor der Kurvenkorrektur.","Demonstration · Draw the front trouser leg outline":"Video · Vorderes Hosenbein zeichnen","11 · Fix intersections and mark crotch points":"11 · Schnittpunkte fixieren und Schrittpunkte markieren","Fix intersections and mark offsets":"Schnittpunkte fixieren und Abstände markieren","Mark crotch points at the waist and hip":"Schrittpunkte an Taille und Hüfte markieren","With Edit Point/Line, select the vertical internal line at the front crotch and the horizontal internal line below the waist. Right-click Add Point at Intersection to fix their crossing.":"Wähle mit Edit Point/Line die senkrechte Innenlinie am vorderen Schritt und die waagerechte Linie unter der Taille. Per Rechtsklick Add Point at Intersection wählen.","Add a point 0.6 cm from the centerline on the front waist line, then a point 0.5 cm from the same centerline on the hip line. Check their direction against the diagram before drawing the front crotch line.":"Setze an der vorderen Taillenlinie einen Punkt 0,6 cm von der Mittellinie entfernt und an der Hüftlinie einen Punkt bei 0,5 cm. Prüfe die Richtung anhand der Skizze.","Demonstration · Fix intersections and mark crotch points":"Video · Schnittpunkte fixieren und Punkte markieren","Right-click menu · Enlarge":"Kontextmenü · Vergrößern","0.6 cm and 0.5 cm points · Enlarge":"Punkte bei 0,6 und 0,5 cm · Vergrößern","12 · Draw the front crotch line":"12 · Vordere Schrittlinie zeichnen","Connect from the front waist point":"Vom vorderen Taillenpunkt aus verbinden","Connect the waist, hip, and crotch":"Taille, Hüfte und Schritt verbinden","Press G for Internal Polygon/Line. Click the upper 0.6 cm point and draw downward.":"Drücke G für Internal Polygon/Line. Klicke auf den oberen 0,6-cm-Punkt und zeichne nach unten.","Hold Ctrl/Command and click the 0.5 cm point on the hip line. Continue downward to the crotch segment to complete this part of the front crotch line.":"Halte Ctrl/Command gedrückt und klicke auf den 0,5-cm-Punkt an der Hüftlinie. Verlängere die Linie bis zum Schrittsegment.","Demonstration · Draw the front crotch line":"Video · Vordere Schrittlinie zeichnen","13 · Mark the midpoint on the side seam":"13 · Mittelpunkt an der Seitennaht markieren","Calculate from the crotch-line distance":"Aus dem Abstand an der Schrittlinie berechnen","Fix the crotch intersection and add a point":"Schrittschnittpunkt fixieren und Punkt setzen","With Edit Point/Line, select the crotch-bottom line and the side line. Right-click Add Point at Intersection to fix their crossing.":"Wähle mit Edit Point/Line die untere Schrittlinie und die Seitenlinie. Per Rechtsklick Add Point at Intersection wählen.","Measure distance A between the front crotch extension and inseam. Divide A by two and use that result to add a point on the side seam. Check its position against the diagram.":"Miss Abstand A zwischen vorderer Schrittweite und Innennaht. Halbiere A und setze damit einen Punkt an der Seitennaht.","Demonstration · Mark the side-seam midpoint":"Video · Mittelpunkt an der Seitennaht markieren","A ÷ 2 point diagram · Enlarge":"Punkteskizze A ÷ 2 · Vergrößern","14 · Organize the guide lines":"14 · Hilfslinien ordnen","Connect the two marked points":"Die beiden markierten Punkte verbinden","Convert the guides to internal lines":"Hilfslinien in Innenlinien umwandeln","Connect the newly added point to the intersection of the crotch-bottom and side lines as a guide for the next drawing step.":"Verbinde den neuen Punkt mit dem Schnittpunkt von unterer Schrittlinie und Seitenlinie als Zeichenhilfe.","With Edit Point/Line, select the two guide lines and convert them to internal lines to keep the pattern view clear. They are positioning guides.":"Wähle mit Edit Point/Line die beiden Hilfslinien und wandle sie in Innenlinien um, damit die Schnittansicht übersichtlich bleibt.","Demonstration · Organize the guide lines":"Video · Hilfslinien ordnen","15 · Draw and refine the crotch curve":"15 · Schrittkurve zeichnen und anpassen","Use a few points along the dashed guide":"Wenige Punkte entlang der gestrichelten Linie setzen","Trace with G, then refine with V":"Mit G nachzeichnen, dann mit V anpassen","Press G and start at the upper marked point. After the first click, hold Ctrl/Command to form a curve. Follow the dashed guide with only a few points, ending at the crotch-bottom intersection.":"Drücke G und beginne am oberen Punkt. Halte nach dem ersten Klick Ctrl/Command für eine Kurve. Folge der gestrichelten Linie mit wenigen Punkten bis zum unteren Schrittschnittpunkt.","Double-click to finish drawing. Press V for Edit Curve Point and refine the curve.":"Beende die Zeichnung mit einem Doppelklick. Drücke V für Edit Curve Point und passe die Kurve an.","Demonstration · Draw and refine the crotch curve":"Video · Schrittkurve zeichnen und anpassen","V curve-point tool · Enlarge":"Kurvenpunkt-Werkzeug V · Vergrößern","16 · Create a 6 cm perpendicular line":"16 · Eine 6-cm-Senkrechte erstellen","Make the lines meet precisely":"Linien genau verbinden","Create a perpendicular line and merge points":"Senkrechte erstellen und Punkte verbinden","With Edit Point/Line, select the line drawn in the previous step. Right-click Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment.":"Wähle mit Edit Point/Line die zuvor gezeichnete Linie. Per Rechtsklick Create Perpendicular Internal Line → Select Segment wählen.","Set the length to 6 cm and Distance from Segment Edge to 0 cm so the perpendicular starts at the segment end and meets the original line.":"Stelle 6 cm Länge und Distance from Segment Edge auf 0 cm, damit die Senkrechte am Linienende beginnt.","Box-select the two points at the intersection, right-click, and choose Merge Points.":"Markiere die beiden Schnittpunkte mit einem Auswahlrahmen und wähle Merge Points.","Demonstration · Create the perpendicular and merge points":"Video · Senkrechte erstellen und Punkte verbinden","Perpendicular-line menu · Enlarge":"Menü für senkrechte Innenlinie · Vergrößern","6 cm and 0 cm settings · Enlarge":"Einstellungen 6 cm und 0 cm · Vergrößern","Merge Points menu · Enlarge":"Menü Punkte verbinden · Vergrößern","17 · Adjust the line position":"17 · Linienposition anpassen","Align the left intersection":"Linken Schnittpunkt ausrichten","Move the line upward and check the intersection":"Linie nach oben verschieben und Schnittpunkt prüfen","With Edit Pattern, select the line just created and move it upward until its left point meets the corresponding line.":"Wähle mit Edit Pattern die eben erstellte Linie und verschiebe sie nach oben, bis ihr linker Punkt die zugehörige Linie trifft.","Check the point-to-line intersection against the video before continuing the draft.":"Prüfe den Schnittpunkt anhand des Videos, bevor du weiterzeichnest.","Demonstration · Adjust the line position":"Video · Linienposition anpassen"}};
